# M / B016 — modern-csharp, project-structure references (backend-layout, solution-layout), project-structure.

C R196 OL DEP-022 | DEFAULT | Use the .slnx solution format by default; legacy .sln only when an external tool or project requirement needs it. | solution file | External tool or project requirement.
C R197 OL DEP-023 | DEFAULT | Repository-level Directory.Build.props holds genuinely shared .NET build settings (target framework, nullable, implicit usings, analysis/compiler settings) and Directory.Packages.props Central Package Management; project-specific settings stay in their owning projects and properties duplicated by dotnet new are removed. | shared .NET build configuration | none stated
C R198 OL DEP-024 | DEFAULT | Repository layout: backend/<Name>.<Layer>/ holds the .NET production projects and, beside them, the backend test projects; frontend/<Name>.Web/ holds the Angular workspace including its tests; docs/ holds maintained documentation; keep these areas separated and do not create a top-level tests/ directory. | repository layout | none stated
C R199 OL DEP-014 | DECIDED | Angular baseline: the latest stable release supported by the selected Node.js created with the current Angular CLI, which selects compatible TypeScript and RxJS versions (no TypeScript upgrade beyond Angular's supported range); standalone APIs, strict mode, routing, zoneless when supported, SCSS, Angular Material and CDK, Vitest; no obsolete directory structure imposed over the CLI's. | Angular workspace | none stated
C R201 OL WF-005 | MUST | Build the affected projects and run the relevant tests; a solution that does not build is not complete (never report successful scaffolding for it). | verification | none stated
C X22 EX DEP-008,DEP-003 | MUST | global.json pins the repository to the intended supported .NET SDK line; when scaffolding select the current stable SDK for the target .NET release (no RC/preview unless explicitly requested) and allow servicing through the chosen rollForward policy. | repository SDK configuration | Preview SDK explicitly requested. | DEP-008 fixes the .NET platform and DEP-003 package versions; no oracle policy requires an SDK pin file. | A scaffolded repository without global.json does not follow the instruction.

